WEBVTT

00:00:05.830 --> 00:00:07.920
A great disaster cometh.

00:00:08.460 --> 00:00:12.290
Do not approach it, for it is the embodiment of ruin.

00:00:13.040 --> 00:00:17.630
Do not touch it, for it is the oracle of death.

00:00:18.750 --> 00:00:20.920
A mother's lament shall invoke calamity

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:23.460
as the newborn wails of despair resound.

00:00:24.420 --> 00:00:27.540
The fairy who is sworn to be an usher of doom

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:32.130
shall drag the surging white flames into severe plight.

00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:36.420
Take heed.

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.580
It is a banquet of tragedy.

00:00:45.460 --> 00:00:48.210
What did... I just see...?

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:49.960
Was that...

00:00:50.750 --> 00:00:52.130
a premonition?

00:00:52.920 --> 00:00:53.790
Cassandra!

00:00:54.130 --> 00:00:55.170
Get up!

00:00:56.460 --> 00:00:59.080
Wh-what's the matter, Daphne?

00:00:59.250 --> 00:01:02.290
People are saying an adventurer
was murdered just outside the city!

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:04.750
M-murdered...?

00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:23.170
Is it Wrong to Try to Pick Up Girls in a Dungeon?  IV

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.460
Cassandra Ilion

00:02:36.040 --> 00:02:40.460
Dream Seer

00:02:39.630 --> 00:02:40.750
I don't believe it...

00:02:42.130 --> 00:02:43.380
Outta the way!

00:02:46.880 --> 00:02:48.580
Someone really did a number on him.

00:02:49.460 --> 00:02:51.130
But we can say for sure this is Jean.

00:02:56.670 --> 00:02:59.380
That settles it. This was definitely a murder.

00:02:59.710 --> 00:03:01.250
Monsters don't leave these kind of wounds.

00:03:01.500 --> 00:03:04.710
I actually saw someone wrapped
in a cloak fleeing the scene!

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.250
Yeah, they were headed for the lower floors!

00:03:07.790 --> 00:03:09.790
It's like I said! The Gale Wind did it!

00:03:10.080 --> 00:03:14.420
I know exactly what that elf looks like because I saw her
back when she was a member of the Astrea Familia!

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:16.960
She's definitely the one who killed Jean!

00:03:17.330 --> 00:03:19.830
The "Gale Wind"? Do they mean the former adventurer?

00:03:19.830 --> 00:03:22.080
Yes. It would seem so.

00:03:22.540 --> 00:03:24.790
All right. What's the best way to handle this?

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:27.460
Oh, come on! You already know
what we have to do, Bors!

00:03:27.460 --> 00:03:28.960
We gotta make her pay!

00:03:28.960 --> 00:03:29.790
Huh?

00:03:30.040 --> 00:03:31.750
We hunt down the Gale Wind and kill her!

00:03:31.920 --> 00:03:34.500
There's no way she's getting away
with killing one of our own, dammit!

00:03:34.750 --> 00:03:35.920
Just hold your horses.

00:03:35.920 --> 00:03:40.000
I've never seen the Gale Wind up close,
but I don't wanna mess with a level 4 of her caliber.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.000
I care more about keeping myself alive, period.

00:03:43.500 --> 00:03:47.130
The Gale Wind already has
a pretty big bounty on her head, right?

00:03:47.130 --> 00:03:50.750
Yeah, I think it was around 80 million valis.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.460
Gather up, ya boneheads!
We're forming an execution squad!

00:03:53.790 --> 00:03:57.210
We're gonna hunt down the Gale Wind
and avenge our dead comrade!

00:03:57.540 --> 00:03:59.170
Yeah!

00:03:59.170 --> 00:04:01.040
They're obviously more interested in the money...

00:04:01.540 --> 00:04:03.670
Not surprising given this is a town full of adventurers.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:07.000
It doesn't matter how tough she is, she's dead meat
against overwhelming numbers like this!

00:04:07.000 --> 00:04:08.710
Yeah! That's the spirit!

00:04:08.710 --> 00:04:10.040
P-please wait a moment!

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.790
We can't be certain the Gale Wind
is guilty of murder just yet, right?

00:04:14.330 --> 00:04:15.920
What're you saying, Rabbit's Foot?

00:04:15.920 --> 00:04:17.380
Did you see something?

00:04:17.790 --> 00:04:19.630
No. That's not what I mean...

00:04:19.880 --> 00:04:23.880
Huh?! Then are you trying to call me a liar or what?!

00:04:24.290 --> 00:04:26.170
Liar isn't really the word I'd use, but...

00:04:26.630 --> 00:04:28.630
Are you positive it was the Gale Wind you saw?!

00:04:28.830 --> 00:04:30.460
I'm beyond positive it was her!

00:04:30.460 --> 00:04:33.130
Keep fighting me on this for no good reason
and I'll make you regret it, punk!

00:04:33.380 --> 00:04:34.710
I have a good reason!

00:04:35.170 --> 00:04:40.000
Everybody in this town remembers what happened after
the Black Goliath attacked. Isn't that right?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:42.420
Obviously! I fought in that battle, myself!

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:43.330
What of it?!

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.040
Well, the Gale Wind was...!

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:46.460
That's enough, boy.

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:48.420
Ms. Aisha...

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:49.880
Good grief.

00:04:50.040 --> 00:04:52.290
Of all the things to be shouting your heads off about...

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.880
Feel free to keep talking about it amongst yourselves.

00:04:55.880 --> 00:04:57.080
O-okay...

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:01.380
All right! Which of you bums wants to get in on the hunt?!

00:05:01.380 --> 00:05:03.250
Me!
I'm in!
Let's do it!

00:05:03.540 --> 00:05:04.710
Wait, Ms. Aisha!

00:05:05.000 --> 00:05:08.040
These people really need to know
that Ms. Ryu was part of that battle!

00:05:08.040 --> 00:05:10.210
It should be enough to get them to reconsider!

00:05:10.210 --> 00:05:11.710
Don't be stupid.

00:05:11.960 --> 00:05:14.710
All that will do is make you look like her accomplice.

00:05:14.710 --> 00:05:15.880
But even so!

00:05:15.880 --> 00:05:19.540
Lady Aisha is absolutely right.
Let's go talk about this somewhere else for now.

00:05:20.080 --> 00:05:23.750
That dream I had earlier...
is it related to this incident somehow?

00:05:25.000 --> 00:05:27.460
So, that elf murdered somebody?

00:05:27.880 --> 00:05:30.580
Based on my personal experiences with Lady Ryu,

00:05:30.920 --> 00:05:33.000
I'm finding this very hard to believe.

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:37.460
Be that as it may, we've all heard the stories of
what happened after her Familia was wiped out.

00:05:37.750 --> 00:05:40.960
She apparently went around killing
the people who were responsible for it.

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:44.000
And it ultimately got her blacklisted.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.080
Ouka!

00:05:45.080 --> 00:05:46.170
Don't get the wrong idea!

00:05:46.630 --> 00:05:50.170
I'm also hoping that this is all just
some kind of misunderstanding.

00:05:50.460 --> 00:05:53.630
The circumstantial evidence does point to the Gale Wind.

00:05:54.040 --> 00:05:56.580
However, there are a few things that caught my attention.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.790
Lady Daphne and I took some time
to examine the corpse earlier.

00:06:00.250 --> 00:06:02.170
Hold on, you two did what now?

00:06:02.710 --> 00:06:05.040
I really didn't want to get near it, to be honest.

00:06:05.460 --> 00:06:08.710
Anyways, in my opinion, all the sharp cuts
that were on the guy's arms and legs

00:06:09.040 --> 00:06:11.670
were very likely done by the Gale Wind.

00:06:12.000 --> 00:06:16.170
She made sure he couldn't run away
by severing the tendons in his all of his limbs.

00:06:16.750 --> 00:06:18.630
I'm willing to bet she was interrogating him.

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:21.830
Yeah. It's his fatal wounds that I thought were strange.

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.080
They were inconsistent with all of the others.

00:06:24.630 --> 00:06:27.080
And stabbing him that many times was definitely overkill.

00:06:27.580 --> 00:06:30.540
It's possible somebody else did it
to try and pin the blame on her.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:33.130
What's with that look, Cassandra?

00:06:33.130 --> 00:06:34.710
Huh?! Oh, nothing!

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:37.250
You sound just like a detective, Daphne.

00:06:38.380 --> 00:06:39.710
It's really cool.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:42.000
J-just shut up!

00:06:42.920 --> 00:06:44.170
To be blunt...

00:06:44.460 --> 00:06:48.000
I'm convinced that Turk guy is lying about what he saw.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:53.750
Back when we all fought against the Black Goliath,
Ms. Ryu really stood out on the battlefield.

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.500
If he's genuinely familiar with what Ms. Ryu looks like,

00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.920
then it doesn't make sense
he wouldn't have noticed her then.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:03.750
That's true. It seems fishy.

00:07:04.130 --> 00:07:06.170
He also kept trying to stir everyone into a frenzy

00:07:06.170 --> 00:07:09.580
by saying they needed to kill the Gale Wind
and that felt kinda forced to me.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:11.460
But more than anything...

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.790
I refuse to believe that Ms. Ryu
would do something so awful.

00:07:15.170 --> 00:07:18.330
It's possible that she's been dragged
into some dangerous business.

00:07:19.000 --> 00:07:20.790
And if that's really the case...

00:07:21.040 --> 00:07:22.250
I want to save her.

00:07:22.630 --> 00:07:23.710
Which is why, I'm...

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:24.880
I have a proposal.

00:07:25.290 --> 00:07:28.170
What do you say that we all agree
to join the hunt for her?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:28.880
Huh?

00:07:29.420 --> 00:07:31.460
B-but why would we?

00:07:32.290 --> 00:07:35.460
If our goal is to prove that Lady Ryu is innocent,

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:41.880
then the most important thing we can do is get in touch
with her before any of the other adventurers can.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:45.460
Let me guess. We intentionally agree
to help hunt her down,

00:07:45.460 --> 00:07:48.080
but then pull a fast one by reaching her
before anyone else has a chance to?

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:49.500
Yep.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:51.080
What do you think, everyone?

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.380
I think we should go, Master Bell!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.080
I'm going to come, too.

00:07:55.460 --> 00:07:59.040
Seems like a big pain in the neck. But I guess I'm in.

00:07:59.250 --> 00:08:00.460
Same here.

00:08:00.460 --> 00:08:02.750
We're all in agreement! Let's hurry and get ready!

00:08:03.130 --> 00:08:04.460
Uh oh...

00:08:04.460 --> 00:08:08.130
I've got a really bad feeling about how this will play out...

00:08:09.330 --> 00:08:10.750
Thanks, you guys!

00:08:11.130 --> 00:08:12.790
Let's get out there and find Ms. Ryu!

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.580
Okay!

00:08:24.710 --> 00:08:25.790
Lion...

00:08:26.130 --> 00:08:27.880
I guess you really aren't coming back.

00:08:28.380 --> 00:08:30.080
You were once obsessed with those evil-doers...

00:08:30.630 --> 00:08:32.920
but I thought it had mostly subsided at this point.

00:08:40.580 --> 00:08:41.710
Lion!

00:08:42.630 --> 00:08:43.920
Your past karma.

00:08:44.500 --> 00:08:46.210
Your connection to the Astrea Familia.

00:08:47.080 --> 00:08:49.000
It'll all burn in the flames of vengeance.

00:08:50.040 --> 00:08:51.580
Are you going down that dark path yet again...

00:08:52.670 --> 00:08:53.630
Lion?

00:08:57.920 --> 00:09:00.500
I can't get that dream out of my head.

00:09:01.500 --> 00:09:05.880
Unless something changes,
I'm terrified that it's going to become reality.

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:11.210
No. I need to calm down and think rationally.

00:09:11.880 --> 00:09:13.170
Then maybe...

00:09:16.250 --> 00:09:19.380
"The fairy who is sworn to be an usher of doom."

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.830
Is it the Gale Wind?! Because if so...

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:25.540
Master Welf.

00:09:25.790 --> 00:09:28.460
Have you made sure that everyone's
equipment is good to go?

00:09:28.460 --> 00:09:30.750
Yep. We've still got some magic swords, too.

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.250
Is everything okay on your end?

00:09:32.250 --> 00:09:33.380
Of course!

00:09:33.710 --> 00:09:38.670
I was able to safely leave that letter in the hands of some
adventurers who are about to head for the surface.

00:09:39.130 --> 00:09:40.210
Excuse me!

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.380
Hey Cassandra. Where's your stuff?

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:43.170
Um, would you...

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:46.130
consider calling this off?

00:09:46.130 --> 00:09:46.960
Huh?

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:49.630
What?

00:09:49.750 --> 00:09:51.960
I just know that something awful will happen.

00:09:51.960 --> 00:09:55.000
So let's withdraw from the hunt and stay here instead!

00:09:55.380 --> 00:09:57.630
Uh, okay, but why exactly...?

00:09:57.630 --> 00:10:01.290
Don't tell me this is because of that prophetic dream
nonsense you always make a fuss about.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:04.500
W-well, actually, it is...

00:10:04.500 --> 00:10:05.830
But this time I...

00:10:06.000 --> 00:10:08.420
How many times do I have to tell you to cut it out!

00:10:08.420 --> 00:10:09.540
It's getting really old!

00:10:11.040 --> 00:10:12.880
I knew they wouldn't believe me...

00:10:13.170 --> 00:10:15.080
Nobody's ever believed me...

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.750
But maybe he will!

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:19.830
M-Mr. Bell! Uh...

00:10:20.250 --> 00:10:21.500
Will you call it off?

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:22.210
Huh?

00:10:24.670 --> 00:10:29.210
I'm sorry, Ms. Cassandra. But I want to save Ms. Ryu!

00:10:31.750 --> 00:10:34.500
Shoot. He won't stop either...

00:10:34.630 --> 00:10:35.460
Cassandra!

00:10:35.460 --> 00:10:37.080
Are you feeling okay?!

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:40.880
I'm sorry, guys. I think it might be best if she didn't go.

00:10:41.130 --> 00:10:44.290
I hate to do this, but I'm going to stay here with her...

00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:45.080
No!

00:10:45.080 --> 00:10:45.790
Huh?

00:10:45.790 --> 00:10:47.040
Absolutely not!

00:10:48.920 --> 00:10:49.960
Anything but that!

00:10:49.960 --> 00:10:51.210
Please no!

00:10:51.580 --> 00:10:55.580
Doing that... would mean abandoning
these people to their fate.

00:10:55.920 --> 00:10:57.420
I can't do that!

00:10:57.880 --> 00:10:59.630
I'm sorry for trying to change your minds.

00:10:59.880 --> 00:11:02.630
It's all right. I'll go.

00:11:05.920 --> 00:11:10.670
We may be able to avoid the worst outcome
if things change from how they were in my dream.

00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.380
I have to...

00:11:13.040 --> 00:11:15.170
find a way to save everyone.

00:11:18.130 --> 00:11:23.210
I finally get a day off from work, but there's nobody to
spend it with since Bell and the others are still out...

00:11:23.580 --> 00:11:25.250
The loneliness must be getting to you, hm?

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:26.750
You can say that again.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:30.830
What about your children, Miach?
Daphne and Cassandra, was it?

00:11:30.830 --> 00:11:32.210
Aren't they on your mind?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:37.580
Of course, I'm always concerned for them.
But I must admit I do enjoy my time alone with Naza.

00:11:37.880 --> 00:11:39.710
We've known each other for a long time.

00:11:39.920 --> 00:11:41.500
So I feel most comfortable with her.

00:11:42.920 --> 00:11:45.420
I p-prepared some tea for you.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.630
Great. Thank you, Naza.

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:50.790
Look at you two, casually getting
all lovey-dovey over there...

00:11:52.540 --> 00:11:55.040
I hope Bell and the gang are doing all right!

00:11:57.380 --> 00:12:01.040
Keep your eyes open! Don't overlook anything
or anybody who seems suspicious!

00:12:01.460 --> 00:12:05.750
This is the Animal People's time to shine!
Put those sensitive noses of yours to work!

00:12:05.920 --> 00:12:06.960
Yessir!

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:10.960
Rumor has it that the Gale Wind
is top-class even among level 4s.

00:12:11.170 --> 00:12:14.000
Rabbit's Foot! That means you're our ace in the hole!

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.080
Uh, sure...

00:12:16.330 --> 00:12:18.380
This guy loves dumping work on other people.

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:19.790
No kidding!

00:12:20.130 --> 00:12:21.920
But this actually works in our favor.

00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:26.380
Having Bell be at the center of the hunt
makes it easier for us to obtain information.

00:12:26.830 --> 00:12:31.580
I have to figure it out soon. There must be
a way to move everyone out of harm's way.

00:12:32.630 --> 00:12:34.830
Hey, while we're on the topic of Cassandra...

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:39.290
I noticed something peculiar about her even back
when she was in the Apollon Familia. Know what I mean?

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:41.420
Indeed. She has foresight.

00:12:42.000 --> 00:12:44.710
The ability to see something that even we gods cannot.

00:12:45.080 --> 00:12:48.250
It means that she will be burdened
with the great unknowns of the lower world.

00:12:48.500 --> 00:12:50.460
That's gotta be really rough for her.

00:12:50.460 --> 00:12:53.460
I guess that explains why she's
a little gloomy all the time, huh?

00:12:53.670 --> 00:12:57.130
It's true that Cassandra always
seems troubled by something.

00:12:57.460 --> 00:13:01.920
But there are times I've seen her with a glowing smile.
Like whenever she's around Bell, for example...

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:03.540
A-are you serious?!

00:13:03.540 --> 00:13:07.920
D-d-d-don't tell me that she's another
one of those vixens trying to lay claim to my Bell!

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.630
I'm pretty sure that's not the case...

00:13:13.420 --> 00:13:14.580
Who could that be?

00:13:18.580 --> 00:13:21.580
It was an adventurer who said they were
asked to deliver this from the 18th floor.

00:13:22.920 --> 00:13:25.170
It's a letter from Little Miss Supporter.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:29.330
But that's weird, I know it takes a hefty sum
to deliver stuff like this from the dungeon.

00:13:29.500 --> 00:13:32.330
I can't imagine she'd be willing
to cough up the money for it...

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:35.000
What?!

00:13:35.290 --> 00:13:38.000
That elf from the tavern was accused of murder?!

00:13:38.000 --> 00:13:40.540
And they formed an execution squad to go after her?!

00:13:41.540 --> 00:13:43.080
What does this mean, Hestia?

00:13:43.080 --> 00:13:45.920
U-unfortunately, I'm just as clueless as you are.

00:13:46.210 --> 00:13:50.290
But apparently Bell's group joined the hunt
for her to try and do something about it.

00:13:50.750 --> 00:13:53.080
And they sent this letter to ask me for a favor.

00:13:53.500 --> 00:13:56.670
What the hell is going on in the dungeon right now?

00:13:57.460 --> 00:14:00.210
All the way down to the 21st floor
and no sign of her, huh?

00:14:01.210 --> 00:14:04.670
Let's agree to never take on quests
to find people in the dungeon.

00:14:05.420 --> 00:14:07.380
Because it's definitely a waste of resources.

00:14:07.960 --> 00:14:10.420
"A mother’s lament shall invoke calamity."

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:13.330
I'm sure that "mother" must be referring to the dungeon.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:15.210
But what's the calamity?

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:17.080
Could it be...?

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:22.040
Um, Ms. Lili? Do you know when
the Floor Boss is due to spawn?

00:14:22.170 --> 00:14:24.170
Are you talking about Amphisbaena?

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.250
Who do you think I am? I've already
double checked when it's due to appear!

00:14:28.540 --> 00:14:31.420
The last time it was defeated
was exactly half a month ago.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:34.630
That means we've got 2 weeks before
the spawning interval is over!

00:14:34.790 --> 00:14:36.460
I covered all my bases!

00:14:36.830 --> 00:14:38.920
Th-that's good...

00:14:39.630 --> 00:14:42.630
Amphisbaena, eh? That's the Rex
of the lower floors, right?

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:45.210
It shows up on the 27th one, as I recall.

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:49.130
Lady Aisha. Did you ever fight against it
during your time in the Ishtar Familia?

00:14:49.580 --> 00:14:50.670
I did.

00:14:50.670 --> 00:14:55.670
The Guild's evaluation has it set at level 6 after
taking its aquatic nature and the terrain into account.

00:14:55.880 --> 00:14:58.630
But based on its strength alone I would say
it's only level 5.

00:14:58.750 --> 00:15:01.330
Considering the number of
upper rank adventurers in this party,

00:15:01.460 --> 00:15:04.630
it shouldn't be a cause for
concern even if it does show up.

00:15:04.630 --> 00:15:07.580
Like I said! It's not going to spawn anytime soon!

00:15:05.710 --> 00:15:09.380
If it's not the Floor Boss, then what on earth could it be?

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:11.830
Mr. Bell?!

00:15:11.830 --> 00:15:16.210
Hey. Feel free to ask me for advice
if there's something on your mind.

00:15:16.210 --> 00:15:17.040
Huh?

00:15:17.420 --> 00:15:21.420
We may come from different Familia,
but we're in the same party right now.

00:15:21.670 --> 00:15:24.460
So, uh, I just want you to know that I'm here to help.

00:15:24.750 --> 00:15:28.960
Here, have a drink. I just fetched some water.
It should be cool and refreshing.

00:15:29.130 --> 00:15:31.750
Um, thank you.

00:15:33.000 --> 00:15:34.330
A-actually...!

00:15:34.330 --> 00:15:35.170
Bors!

00:15:36.420 --> 00:15:37.540
There's a herd of Mammoth Fools!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.920
Damn, a whole herd of those big whoppers?!

00:15:40.330 --> 00:15:41.670
Prepare for battle, ya slackers!

00:15:42.290 --> 00:15:43.790
Come on, Rabbit's Foot!

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.210
Coming!

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:49.330
"Surging white flames."

00:15:49.790 --> 00:15:51.670
That part probably refers to Mr. Bell.

00:15:52.580 --> 00:15:56.790
He'll eventually meet with the Gale Wind and then...
get dragged into whatever she's involved in.

00:15:58.210 --> 00:16:01.040
Unlike the others, my dream didn't indicate that he died.

00:16:01.790 --> 00:16:04.540
But what about the "severe plight" part?

00:16:05.170 --> 00:16:06.460
Um, Mr. Crozzo?

00:16:07.920 --> 00:16:09.130
Just call me Welf!

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.790
Mr. Welf... u-um...

00:16:13.380 --> 00:16:14.630
I have a favor to ask!

00:16:36.920 --> 00:16:38.830
And you want me to do it?

00:16:39.750 --> 00:16:41.080
Is that a problem?

00:16:41.080 --> 00:16:44.630
Well, it's definitely possible.
But it wouldn't sit right with me, to be honest.

00:16:45.130 --> 00:16:47.630
I only want to equip him with my handiwork.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:49.380
It's a personal rule.

00:16:50.250 --> 00:16:54.460
I know you might find this hard to believe,
but I have a sixth sense.

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:58.290
And I can tell that Mr. Bell is going
to find himself in great danger.

00:16:58.580 --> 00:17:03.130
Because he always goes overboard
for the sake of others. It's in his nature.

00:17:03.670 --> 00:17:05.920
Which is why I want to save him from that fate!

00:17:08.380 --> 00:17:09.670
All right, I'll do it.

00:17:10.630 --> 00:17:12.040
You will? Really?!

00:17:12.040 --> 00:17:15.130
Yep. I had a similar problem with magic swords.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:17.630
But I'm done with weighing my pride
against the wellbeing of my friends.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:22.330
Besides, Bell is likely to go overboard.
I agree with you on that.

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:24.790
I mean, he's done it plenty of times before.

00:17:25.040 --> 00:17:26.960
That's the kind of guy my partner is.

00:17:27.880 --> 00:17:30.000
Hey, Lil Squeak. Get the tools out for me.

00:17:31.170 --> 00:17:34.130
I'm gonna finish this up before
they take out all of the monsters.

00:17:46.460 --> 00:17:48.790
It's almost been a whole day at this point.

00:17:49.080 --> 00:17:51.170
Our pace seems to be a little slow to catch up.

00:17:51.170 --> 00:17:54.250
Maybe, but the 24th floor is just up ahead.

00:17:54.630 --> 00:17:59.210
If Lady Ryu is somewhere in this Colossal Tree Labyrinth,
we should find some trace of her soon.

00:17:59.880 --> 00:18:02.380
No. The Gale Wind isn't up here.

00:18:03.130 --> 00:18:06.460
Assuming my dream is right,
the tragedy will befall us at...

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.630
The hell? Was that an explosion?

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:16.750
It came from below us!

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:19.000
Bors! It's gotta be her!

00:18:34.460 --> 00:18:36.540
Sounds like it's coming from the 27th floor.

00:18:36.880 --> 00:18:39.420
All right! We're splitting up the party
and heading further down!

00:18:39.420 --> 00:18:42.290
Anybody who stays behind should
keep watch over this passageway!

00:18:42.290 --> 00:18:44.330
Okay!

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:49.040
My dream took place on the 27th floor,
at the base of the Great Falls.

00:18:49.420 --> 00:18:51.380
I can't let them go down there.

00:18:51.790 --> 00:18:55.670
This is where things get serious. We'll need to hurry
and find Lady Ryu before any of the others.

00:18:55.670 --> 00:18:56.380
Right.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:59.580
If we all agree to join the party heading
down to the 27th floor, then...

00:18:59.580 --> 00:19:00.580
P-pardon me!

00:19:00.790 --> 00:19:03.210
Is there really a need for us to tag along?

00:19:03.210 --> 00:19:03.920
Huh?

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:07.130
W-well, if there are too many people in the party...

00:19:07.460 --> 00:19:09.790
it would be hard to get through
the narrow tunnels and stuff.

00:19:11.000 --> 00:19:13.790
O-oh no. This totally isn't going to work.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:16.920
I agree with Cassandra on this.

00:19:18.460 --> 00:19:21.290
We just don't have enough
experience with these lower floors.

00:19:21.630 --> 00:19:23.630
It'll be hard enough to keep up much less search around.

00:19:24.170 --> 00:19:26.210
You make a good point.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:30.960
The party that's going down will need to be moving
pretty fast. So let's give up on everyone going together.

00:19:31.380 --> 00:19:32.130
Okay.

00:19:33.540 --> 00:19:37.500
Then it'll be Master Bell and Lady Aisha
who go down to the 27th floor.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:38.710
Everyone else will...

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:41.830
U-uh, hold on!

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:44.420
I think Ms. Aisha should stay behind with everyone else!

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.830
Care to explain why?

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:48.330
W-well, it's...

00:19:49.080 --> 00:19:50.830
for Ms. Haruhime's sake!

00:19:51.630 --> 00:19:56.500
The other day, I was the one who carried Ms. Haruhime
as we made our way back to the 18th floor,

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:58.420
but it was a real struggle for me!

00:19:58.830 --> 00:20:00.130
She's so heavy!

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:06.580
S-so, just in case something happens,
I think it would be better to have Ms. Aisha around.

00:20:06.960 --> 00:20:09.040
You know, because Ms. Haruhime is so hard to carry!

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:13.960
I'm lying. Please forgive me!

00:20:13.960 --> 00:20:17.790
Well, she's definitely filled out a lot compared
to when we were in the Far East.

00:20:17.790 --> 00:20:19.080
Especially the chest area!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:20.130
Is that so?!

00:20:20.500 --> 00:20:22.040
Enough, you guys!

00:20:22.460 --> 00:20:25.330
It sounds like you need to put on some muscle then, girl.

00:20:25.630 --> 00:20:29.040
Because I'm not always going
to be able to look after her, even if I stay.

00:20:30.250 --> 00:20:31.920
O-okay then...

00:20:32.960 --> 00:20:34.380
Hey, Ms. Aisha?

00:20:35.210 --> 00:20:39.710
I think Ms. Cassandra has a point.
Can you please stay here on the 25th floor?

00:20:43.830 --> 00:20:47.420
Makes sense. I get where you're coming from.

00:20:47.830 --> 00:20:48.710
But...

00:20:49.380 --> 00:20:51.460
when you eventually run into that elf,

00:20:51.880 --> 00:20:54.710
I have high doubts that you'll be
able to handle her on your own.

00:20:57.000 --> 00:20:58.830
I'm putting my faith in Ms. Ryu.

00:21:00.790 --> 00:21:01.750
Hmph.

00:21:02.500 --> 00:21:03.790
It's your funeral.

00:21:05.960 --> 00:21:08.500
Here, Bell. I've got something for you.

00:21:10.130 --> 00:21:11.170
What's this?

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:14.080
I cut off part of Lil Squeak's robe earlier to make it.

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:16.710
It's a Goliath Scarf.

00:21:17.670 --> 00:21:20.830
Thank you. But are you sure about this, Welf?

00:21:20.830 --> 00:21:24.790
Heh. Well, the truth is that I wish you
only used my custom-made armor.

00:21:24.790 --> 00:21:26.790
But that lady over there practically
begged me to make this.

00:21:28.500 --> 00:21:29.290
Huh?

00:21:32.580 --> 00:21:35.380
Ms. Cassandra. I really appreciate this!

00:21:35.790 --> 00:21:37.130
D-don't mention it.

00:21:37.630 --> 00:21:41.250
Mr. Bell might actually believe me
if I tell him about my dream.

00:21:41.250 --> 00:21:44.830
But, even if that were the case,
I'm sure it wouldn't stop him.

00:21:44.830 --> 00:21:47.330
Please come back in one piece, Mr. Bell.

00:21:47.920 --> 00:21:52.330
Once we get back to the surface, I'd love
to talk more with you about all sorts of things.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.960
All ya ingrates going down to the 27th floor,
get the hell over here!

00:22:00.080 --> 00:22:02.170
Well then. I'm off!

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Next Time

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Mirabilis

00:23:37.000 --> 00:23:42.000
Chaos

00:23:38.580 --> 00:23:40.710
Next time: "Mirabilis."
